", "id": "4191951167799953", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819239_4191951171133286_6008220942567939390_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FFZQ4eVPL34Q7kNvwHzy1CJ&_nc_oc=AdnQ9vPiyszA-HWFwi6y2WL23FeR3jq0z2PmotpfqjWcJY_Dxs0HmXeqZpkt0l4D26A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyW5guTzbAFxhXJDMMloKzWoJkBNrnfHhNnHIjUCCwJUw&oe=69B55BF6"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_44_20251202-131523.png", "id": "853472417082939", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822550_853472423749605_6621515077070126422_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A7SvmECSMrsQ7kNvwEPczMg&_nc_oc=AdnBqzXz7NxEWvlqh5-bgOxBoiqxUfYCY4Thj1wQMbwdwtxdCrhLKNJdJIEeLfxOvHQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxgboYEKuc4oBVam75yrKh8Evye5qgF44EBszvCO3blew&oe=69B57352"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "4245956272328542", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821674_4245956275661875_1126371269852687192_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w4YnXLH4OKIQ7kNvwGgis2q&_nc_oc=AdmLFITlQJ_Iokp86jL9vGx7LbitQhuetFyTIupsSX9P90M_3jsb3nCetL6LHqv-Ses&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyVINLogz1Bw4ruEIdgkLO12AJEux3NJZPI2q_nFKxFeA&oe=69B55867"}, "display_name": "Dig To Escape", "keywords": ["Prison", "Escape", "Dig", "Hole", "simulator"], "long_description": "#                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      \n# Dig to Escape\n\n**Grab your shovel and get digging!**  \n\nDig to Escape is a stylized VR prison-break game where you dig, survive, and outsmart the mole to escape.\n\n{2046789639497740}\n**Dig for upgrades**\n\nMine valuable minerals and sell them to upgrade your tools. Better gear means faster digging, deeper tunnels, and more escape options.\n\n\n{1547839482800416}\n**Watch out for the mole**\n\nA sneaky thief is after your loot. Catch him before he makes off with your hard-earned minerals!\n\n\n\n{1551401099280034}\n**Be the inmate boss**\n\nBrawl, intimidate, or outsmart other inmates. Take on optional quests that can help your escape\u2014or make things much more dangerous.\n", "short_description": "Grab your shovel and dig your way to freedom!\nOutsmart guards, brawl with inmates, and tackle wacky quests as you tunnel through a chaotic VR prison break adventure."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "940011138503964", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Dig To Escape", "keywords": ["Gef\u00e4ngnis", "Ausbruch", "graben", "Loch", "Simulator"], "long_description": "#                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      \n# Dig to Escape\n\n**Schnapp dir deine Schaufel und fang an zu graben!**  \n\nDig to Escape ist ein stilisiertes VR-Gef\u00e4ngnisausbruchsspiel, in dem du gr\u00e4bst, \u00fcberlebst und den Maulwurf \u00fcberlistest, um zu entkommen.\n\n{1237325348507167}\n**Grabe nach Upgrades**\n\nBaue wertvolle Mineralien ab und verkaufe sie, um deine Werkzeuge zu verbessern. Bessere Ausr\u00fcstung bedeutet schnelleres Graben, tiefere Tunnel und mehr Fluchtm\u00f6glichkeiten.\n\n\n{25994835953478522}\n**Pass auf den Maulwurf auf**\n\nEin hinterlistiger Dieb hat es auf deine Beute abgesehen. Schnapp ihn, bevor er mit deinen hart erarbeiteten Mineralien entkommt!\n\n\n\n{912532344844187}\n**Werde der Boss unter den Insassen**\n\nK\u00e4mpfe, sch\u00fcchtere ein oder \u00fcberliste andere Insassen. \u00dcbernimm optionale Quests, die deine Flucht unterst\u00fctzen \u2014 oder alles deutlich gef\u00e4hrlicher machen.\n\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Schnapp dir deine Schaufel und grabe dich in die Freiheit!\n\u00dcberliste die W\u00e4chter, pr\u00fcgle dich mit Mitgefangenen und meistere verr\u00fcckte Quests, w\u00e4hrend du dich durch ein chaotisches VR-Gef\u00e4ngnisausbruch-Abenteuer gr\u00e4bst."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "914435661513480", "locale": "ru_RU", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Dig To Escape", "keywords": ["\u0442\u044e\u0440\u044c\u043c\u0430", "\u043f\u043e\u0431\u0435\u0433", "\u043a\u043e\u043f\u0430\u0442\u044c", "\u044f\u043c\u0430", "\u0441\u0438\u043c\u0443\u043b\u044f\u0442\u043e\u0440"], "long_description": "#                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      \n# \u041a\u043e\u043f\u0430\u0439, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u0441\u0431\u0435\u0436\u0430\u0442\u044c\n\n**\u0412\u043e\u0437\u044c\u043c\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u043b\u043e\u043f\u0430\u0442\u0443 \u0438 \u043d\u0430\u0447\u0438\u043d\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u043a\u043e\u043f\u0430\u0442\u044c!**  \n\n\u041a\u043e\u043f\u0430\u0439, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u0441\u0431\u0435\u0436\u0430\u0442\u044c \u2014 \u044d\u0442\u043e \u0441\u0442\u0438\u043b\u0438\u0437\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u043d\u0430\u044f VR-\u0438\u0433\u0440\u0430 \u043f\u0440\u043e \u043f\u043e\u0431\u0435\u0433 \u0438\u0437 \u0442\u044e\u0440\u044c\u043c\u044b, \u0433\u0434\u0435 \u0432\u044b \u043a\u043e\u043f\u0430\u0435\u0442\u0435, \u0432\u044b\u0436\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0442\u0435 \u0438 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0445\u0438\u0442\u0440\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0442\u0435 \u043a\u0440\u043e\u0442\u0430, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u0441\u0431\u0435\u0436\u0430\u0442\u044c.\n\n{2842689259414941}\n**\u041a\u043e\u043f\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0443\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0439**\n\n\u0414\u043e\u0431\u044b\u0432\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0446\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u043c\u0438\u043d\u0435\u0440\u0430\u043b\u044b \u0438 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0434\u0430\u0432\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0438\u0445, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u0443\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0438 \u0438\u043d\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0443\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442\u044b. \u041b\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0435\u0435 \u0441\u043d\u0430\u0440\u044f\u0436\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u043e\u0437\u043d\u0430\u0447\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u0431\u043e\u043b\u0435\u0435 \u0431\u044b\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0435 \u043a\u043e\u043f\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435, \u0431\u043e\u043b\u0435\u0435 \u0433\u043b\u0443\u0431\u043e\u043a\u0438\u0435 \u0442\u0443\u043d\u043d\u0435\u043b\u0438 \u0438 \u0431\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0435 \u0432\u0430\u0440\u0438\u0430\u043d\u0442\u043e\u0432 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u043f\u043e\u0431\u0435\u0433\u0430.\n\n\n{798885056564342}\n**\u041e\u0441\u0442\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0433\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435\u0441\u044c \u043a\u0440\u043e\u0442\u0430**\n\n\u0425\u0438\u0442\u0440\u044b\u0439 \u0432\u043e\u0440 \u043f\u043e\u0441\u043b\u0435 \u0432\u0430\u0448\u0435\u0439 \u0434\u043e\u0431\u044b\u0447\u0438. \u041f\u043e\u0439\u043c\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0435\u0433\u043e, \u043f\u0440\u0435\u0436\u0434\u0435 \u0447\u0435\u043c \u043e\u043d \u0443\u0442\u0430\u0449\u0438\u0442 \u0432\u0430\u0448\u0438 \u0442\u044f\u0436\u0435\u043b\u043e \u0437\u0430\u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u043c\u0438\u043d\u0435\u0440\u0430\u043b\u044b!\n\n\n{2334285103750404}\n**\u0421\u0442\u0430\u043d\u044c\u0442\u0435 \u0433\u043b\u0430\u0432\u043d\u044b\u043c \u0437\u0430\u043a\u043b\u044e\u0447\u0451\u043d\u043d\u044b\u043c**\n\n\u0414\u0440\u0430\u043a\u0438, \u0437\u0430\u043f\u0443\u0433\u0438\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0445\u0438\u0442\u0440\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0433\u0438\u0445 \u0437\u0430\u043a\u043b\u044e\u0447\u0451\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0445. \u0412\u044b\u043f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u044f\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u043d\u0435\u043e\u0431\u044f\u0437\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0437\u0430\u0434\u0430\u043d\u0438\u044f, \u043a\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0440\u044b\u0435 \u043c\u043e\u0433\u0443\u0442 \u043f\u043e\u043c\u043e\u0447\u044c \u0432\u0430\u043c \u0441\u0431\u0435\u0436\u0430\u0442\u044c \u2014 \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u0441\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u0442\u044c \u0432\u0441\u0451 \u0433\u043e\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0434\u043e \u043e\u043f\u0430\u0441\u043d\u0435\u0435.\n\n\n", "short_description": "\u0412\u043e\u0437\u044c\u043c\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u043b\u043e\u043f\u0430\u0442\u0443 \u0438 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0436\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u043f\u0443\u0442\u044c \u043a \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0431\u043e\u0434\u0435! \u041f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0445\u0438\u0442\u0440\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u043e\u0445\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0443, \u0434\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u043e\u0442\u043f\u043e\u0440 \u0437\u0430\u043a\u043b\u044e\u0447\u0451\u043d\u043d\u044b\u043c \u0438 \u0432\u044b\u043f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u044f\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0441\u0443\u043c\u0430\u0441\u0448\u0435\u0434\u0448\u0438\u0435 \u0437\u0430\u0434\u0430\u043d\u0438\u044f, \u043f\u0440\u043e\u043a\u043b\u0430\u0434\u044b\u0432\u0430\u044f \u0442\u0443\u043d\u043d\u0435\u043b\u044c \u0447\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0437 \u0445\u0430\u043e\u0442\u0438\u0447\u043d\u043e\u0435 VR-\u043f\u043e\u0431\u0435\u0433 \u0438\u0437 \u0442\u044e\u0440\u044c\u043c\u044b."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "771056666058242", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Dig To Escape", "keywords": ["prison", "\u00e9vasion", "creuser", "trou", "simulateur"], "long_description": "#                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      \n# Creusez pour vous \u00e9chapper\n\n**Prenez votre pelle et commencez \u00e0 creuser !**  \n\nDig to Escape est un jeu VR d\u2019\u00e9vasion de prison stylis\u00e9 o\u00f9 vous creusez, survivez et d\u00e9jouez la taupe pour vous \u00e9chapper.\n\n{1446378773935189}\n**Creusez pour des am\u00e9liorations**\n\nExtrayez des min\u00e9raux pr\u00e9cieux et vendez-les pour am\u00e9liorer vos outils. Un meilleur \u00e9quipement signifie un creusage plus rapide, des tunnels plus profonds et davantage d\u2019options d\u2019\u00e9vasion.\n\n\n{4352204881683278}\n**Attention \u00e0 la taupe**\n\nUn voleur sournois est apr\u00e8s votre butin. Attrapez-le avant qu\u2019il ne s\u2019enfuie avec vos min\u00e9raux durement gagn\u00e9s !\n\n\n\n{1733297934339557}\n**Devenez le chef des d\u00e9tenus**\n\nBagarrez-vous, intimidez ou d\u00e9jouez les autres d\u00e9tenus. Accomplissez des qu\u00eates optionnelles qui peuvent aider votre \u00e9vasion \u2014 ou rendre les choses bien plus dangereuses.\n\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Prenez votre pelle et creusez votre chemin vers la libert\u00e9 !\nD\u00e9jouez les gardiens, bagarrez-vous avec les d\u00e9tenus et relevez des qu\u00eates d\u00e9jant\u00e9es en creusant votre \u00e9vasion \u00e0 travers une aventure chaotique d\u2019\u00e9vasion de prison en VR."}]}, "developer_name": "K&K Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://knk-studio.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "K&K Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://knk-studio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26074657642224139"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820441_1172876958090826_2859041007171837552_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2ESJeZxTYoMQ7kNvwHTi9IT&_nc_oc=AdnVnO9MhM9my2zqEv6LOhuXUoYyE3a9n9mBZdm4IyllrmlN1XRAKj1uDN5z4Xa3yEA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwo8CJjx77T8kaQVwI0MhoBmjdFLyr3FiceIxHOrH-2qA&oe=69B5622B"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Dig To Escape", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Adventure", "id": "2691890164460465"}, {"topic_name": "Simulation", "id": "331529188132278"}], "release_date": 1766826000, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "24491705887185997", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "24491705840519335", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "2874604362736422"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "4445341382412177", "image_type"